oracle GNU Make 4.4.1
outcome success
file Makefile kept 4
| all:
| 	@printf '%s\n' 'origin=[$(origin MAKEFILES)]' 'flavor=[$(flavor MAKEFILES)]' \
| 	  'value=[$(MAKEFILES)]' 'list=[$(MAKEFILE_LIST)]' > out
| 	@printf 'child=[%s]\n' "$$(env | grep -c '^MAKEFILES=' || true)" >> out
file out touched 5
| origin=[default]
| flavor=[simple]
| value=[]
| list=[Makefile]
| child=[0]
